  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Thursday 17 December 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of Mairangi Bay’s most prestigious locations, this modern three-bedroom townhouse delivers the ultimate easy-care coastal lifestyle, complete with beautiful sea views.\r\n\r\nPerfectly placed in the heart of the Bays, you’re just a short stroll from both Mairangi Bay and Murrays Bay beaches, with fabulous coastal walks, village cafés and restaurants all close at hand.\r\n\r\nFamilies will love the convenience of walking distance to Rangitoto College and Murrays Bay Intermediate, while professionals and downsizers will appreciate the lock-up-and-leave ease and effortless lifestyle on offer.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re searching for a stylish permanent home, a city escape or the perfect coastal pad, this is an opportunity to secure a sought-after Bays address and enjoy everything this special location has to offer.\r\n\r\nSHORT NOTICE AUCTION – DON’T MISS OUT!\r\n\r\nCall now to arrange your private viewing. Coastal living starts here!",
